[{"id":"marker0","name":"Saltoningt Volcano","legend":"Dormant volcano. Height: 5184 m."},{"id":"marker1","name":"Horraltabla","legend":"A geothermal springs with naturally heated water that provide relaxation and medicinal benefits. Average temperature is 34°C."},{"id":"marker2","name":"Bacaldozar Spring of Life","legend":"This legendary water source is whispered about in ancient tales and believed to possess mystical properties. The spring emanates crystal-clear water, shimmering with an otherworldly iridescence that sparkles even in the dimmest light."},{"id":"marker3","name":"Mevizsol — salt mining town","legend":"Mevizsol is a mining town of 655 people just nearby the salt mine."},{"id":"marker4","name":"Victola — lead mining town","legend":"Victola is a mining town of 1157 people just nearby the lead mine."},{"id":"marker5","name":"Phais — salt mining town","legend":"Phais is a mining town of 4795 people just nearby the salt mine."},{"id":"marker6","name":"Dubki — silver mining town","legend":"Dubki is a mining town of 897 people just nearby the silver mine."},{"id":"marker7","name":"Beraoleife — iron mining town","legend":"Beraoleife is a mining town of 7683 people just nearby the iron mine."},{"id":"marker8","name":"Dubricate — gold mining town","legend":"Dubricate is a mining town of 1005 people just nearby the gold mine."},{"id":"marker9","name":"The Amber Antelope","legend":"A big and famous roadside tavern. Delicious mashed oranges with sparkling sap is served here."},{"id":"marker10","name":"The Honest Tavern","legend":"A big and famous roadside tavern. Delicious baked olives with salty tea is served here."},{"id":"marker11","name":"The Golden Owl","legend":"A big and famous roadside tavern. Delicious braised duck with golden mead is served here."},{"id":"marker12","name":"The Great Antelope","legend":"A big and famous roadside tavern. Delicious dried pasta with black nectar is served here."},{"id":"marker13","name":"The Brown Camel","legend":"A big and famous roadside inn. Delicious dry-aged peas with yellow kvass is served here."},{"id":"marker14","name":"The Purple Hawk","legend":"A big and famous roadside tavern. Delicious pan-fried corn with blue gin is served here."},{"id":"marker15","name":"The Light Mantis","legend":"A big and famous roadside tavern. Delicious steamed cabbage with fire mead is served here."},{"id":"marker16","name":"The Brown Wolf","legend":"A big and famous roadside inn. Delicious steamed beet with blue milk is served here."},{"id":"marker17","name":"The Big Bear","legend":"A big and famous roadside inn. Delicious dry-aged bear with green rom is served here."},{"id":"marker18","name":"The Far Inn","legend":"A big and famous roadside inn. Delicious pickled pork with black kumis is served here."},{"id":"marker19","name":"Herharbach Lighthouse","legend":"A lighthouse to serve as a beacon for ships in the open sea."},{"id":"marker20","name":"Euliobrinan Lighthouse","legend":"A lighthouse to serve as a beacon for ships in the open sea."},{"id":"marker21","name":"Harlingham Waterfall","legend":"A breathtaking waterfall cuts through the landscape."},{"id":"marker22","name":"Karacheya Battlefield","legend":"A historical battle of the Hotelese Crusade. \r\nDate: May 19, 1816 Pedolita Era."},{"id":"marker23","name":"Preventia Battlefield","legend":"A historical battle of the Fiugnitian Conflict. \r\nDate: October 1, 1886 Pedolita Era."},{"id":"marker24","name":"Syrva Battlefield","legend":"A historical battle of the Lasnian Rebellion. \r\nDate: February 19, 1885 Pedolita Era."},{"id":"marker25","name":"Cervoy Battlefield","legend":"A historical battle of the Ocrentean Campaign. \r\nDate: April 17, 1885 Pedolita Era."},{"id":"marker26","name":"Dungeon","legend":"<div>Undiscovered dungeon. See <a href=\"https://watabou.github.io/one-page-dungeon/?seed=92723781515\" target=\"_blank\">One page dungeon</a></div><iframe style=\"pointer-events: none;\" src=\"https://watabou.github.io/one-page-dungeon/?seed=92723781515\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin\"></iframe>"},{"id":"marker27","name":"Dungeon","legend":"<div>Undiscovered dungeon. See <a href=\"https://watabou.github.io/one-page-dungeon/?seed=92723785417\" target=\"_blank\">One page dungeon</a></div><iframe style=\"pointer-events: none;\" src=\"https://watabou.github.io/one-page-dungeon/?seed=92723785417\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin\"></iframe>"},{"id":"marker28","name":"Dungeon","legend":"<div>Undiscovered dungeon. See <a href=\"https://watabou.github.io/one-page-dungeon/?seed=92723785395\" target=\"_blank\">One page dungeon</a></div><iframe style=\"pointer-events: none;\" src=\"https://watabou.github.io/one-page-dungeon/?seed=92723785395\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin\"></iframe>"},{"id":"marker29","name":"Dungeon","legend":"<div>Undiscovered dungeon. See <a href=\"https://watabou.github.io/one-page-dungeon/?seed=92723781531\" target=\"_blank\">One page dungeon</a></div><iframe style=\"pointer-events: none;\" src=\"https://watabou.github.io/one-page-dungeon/?seed=92723781531\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin\"></iframe>"},{"id":"marker30","name":"Dungeon","legend":"<div>Undiscovered dungeon. See <a href=\"https://watabou.github.io/one-page-dungeon/?seed=92723784097\" target=\"_blank\">One page dungeon</a></div><iframe style=\"pointer-events: none;\" src=\"https://watabou.github.io/one-page-dungeon/?seed=92723784097\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin\"></iframe>"},{"id":"marker31","name":"Dungeon","legend":"<div>Undiscovered dungeon. See <a href=\"https://watabou.github.io/one-page-dungeon/?seed=92723781829\" target=\"_blank\">One page dungeon</a></div><iframe style=\"pointer-events: none;\" src=\"https://watabou.github.io/one-page-dungeon/?seed=92723781829\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin\"></iframe>"},{"id":"marker32","name":"Wither Monster","legend":"Tipplers say a relic monster of 11 m long inhabits Wither Lake. Truth or lie, folks are afraid to fish in the lake."},{"id":"marker33","name":"Albleford Monster","legend":"Old sailors tell stories of a gigantic sea monster inhabiting these dangerous waters. Rumors say it can be 31 m long."},{"id":"marker34","name":"Veyashe Beast","legend":"Tipplers speak of a great Beast who inhabits Veyashe hills and steals cattle at night."},{"id":"marker35","name":"Gopolch Forest","legend":"A forest sacred to local Witnesses of Ahmakulai."},{"id":"marker36","name":"Hinpaapi Pinery","legend":"A pinery sacred to local Witnesses of Ahmakulai."},{"id":"marker37","name":"Kornogica Palm Grove","legend":"A palm grove sacred to local Witnesses of Ahmakulai."},{"id":"marker38","name":"Giennevan Hyenas","legend":"A gang of forest bandits."},{"id":"marker39","name":"Onquevote Badgers","legend":"A gang of mounted brigands."},{"id":"marker40","name":"Vaalasevits Falcons","legend":"A gang of forest bandits."},{"id":"marker41","name":"Monti Snakes","legend":"A gang of forest brigands."},{"id":"marker42","name":"Alernum Spiders","legend":"A gang of forest bandits."},{"id":"marker43","name":"Pirates","legend":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"id":"marker44","name":"Pirates","legend":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"id":"marker45","name":"Pirates","legend":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"id":"marker46","name":"Gatford Runestone","legend":"An ancient runestone. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ᢦᡳᡖᢑ᠐ᢁᠭᠼᢋᡝᢡᠭᢡᡁᠻᠵᢁᡖᠪᡗᡓᠻᡕᢁᠼᠮᢡᢠᢑᡔᢑᠾᠪᡯᢜᢒᠾᡞᡲᡡᠼᡆᡠᡜᢟᢠᠲᠦᡀᠼᠠᡜᠦᢛᢑᢡᠨᡲᡮᢁᡳᡲᢤᡳᢠ᠒ᠧᠻᡔᢋᠼᢞᡲᠼᠡᢟ</div>"},{"id":"marker47","name":"Borium Effigy","legend":"An ancient effigy. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ⳒⳜⳄⲴⲶⳒⲴⳤⳚⳚⳒⳄ ⳎⳊⳒⳲ⳥ⲸⳜⳖⳤⳭⳲⳠⳁⲶⲴⳈⲴ Ⳳ ⳜⳚⳜⲼ⳾ⳤⲸⳜⳚⳒⲾ⳩⳹</div>"},{"id":"marker48","name":"Torzhesk Column","legend":"An ancient column. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">\udc0d\udc15 \udc3f\ud802\ud802𐠲\ud802\ud802𐠌\udc01𐠿 \ud802𐠡\ud802\ud802𐠖\udc17 \ud802𐠋 \udc24\udc1e\udc2a\udc37\udc03\ud802𐠄 𐠚\udc03\udc22𐠸\udc3c\ud802\ud802𐠈\udc0e\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802 \ud802𐠣\ud802</div>"},{"id":"marker49","name":"Mouton Obelisk","legend":"An ancient obelisk. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">𐠔\udc13\ud802𐠂𐠴\udc11𐠱\ud802 \ud802\ud802\ud802𐠤\udc0a\udc3f\udc19\udc1e\udc1d𐠗𐠔𐠮\udc12\ud802𐠈\udc27\udc14\udc04\udc33\ud802 𐠪\udc3f\ud802𐠡\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠤\udc1b\ud802\ud802𐠤\udc13\udc35𐠮\ud802\ud802𐠦𐠅 \udc15\udc17\udc1c\udc2d\ud802𐠃\udc38\ud802</div>"},{"id":"marker50","name":"Divium Pillar","legend":"An ancient pillar. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ተተጠጸ ፀፐወሐነደለፐቀኀጰዘደወቀ ዐነጠዐሐ ዘዘበ ጰኀሰሀሐፐሀጸበ ነ ከረፀ ሐፐተ</div>"},{"id":"marker51","name":"Ruined Settlement","legend":"Ruins of an ancient settlement. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker52","name":"Ruined Outpost","legend":"Ruins of an ancient outpost. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker53","name":"Ruined Outpost","legend":"Ruins of an ancient outpost. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker54","name":"Ruined City","legend":"Ruins of an ancient city. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker55","name":"Lohtinenlin Archive","legend":"A vast collection of knowledge, including many rare and ancient tomes."},{"id":"marker56","name":"Travelling Breathtaking Circus","legend":"Roll up, roll up, this breathtaking circus is here for a limited time only."},{"id":"marker57","name":"Travelling Unmissable Circus","legend":"Roll up, roll up, this unmissable circus is here for a limited time only."},{"id":"marker58","name":"Travelling Unmissable Circus","legend":"Roll up, roll up, this unmissable circus is here for a limited time only."},{"id":"marker59","name":"Freiras Tournament","legend":"Warriors from around the land gather for a tournament of speed in Freiras, with fame, fortune and favour on offer to the victor."},{"id":"marker60","name":"Bepan Fair","legend":"A fair is being held in Bepan, with all manner of local and foreign goods and services on offer."},{"id":"marker61","name":"Minor Jetty","legend":"A small location along the Echilly Fork to launch boats from sits here, along with a weary looking owner, willing to sell passage along the river."},{"id":"marker62","name":"Hares migration","legend":"A huge group of hares are migrating, whether part of their annual routine, or something more extraordinary."},{"id":"marker63","name":"Ibises migration","legend":"A huge group of ibises are migrating, whether part of their annual routine, or something more extraordinary."},{"id":"marker64","name":"Peculiar mirage","legend":"This peculiar mirage has been luring travellers out of their way for eons."},{"id":"marker65","name":"Foboszloly Ravine","legend":"The Foboszloly Ravine. Locals claim that it is a good spot to hid treasure."},{"id":"marker66","name":"Verannola Tomb","legend":"This cursed necropolis is veiled in perpetual twilight, perpetuating a sense of impending doom. Dark enchantments shroud the tombs, and the moans of anguished souls resound through its crumbling halls."},{"id":"marker67","name":"Wigtonrith Mausoleum","legend":"Rising from the desolate landscape, this sinister necropolis is a testament to necromantic power. Its skeletal spires cast ominous shadows, concealing forbidden knowledge and arcane secrets."},{"id":"marker68","name":"Random encounter","legend":"<div>You have encountered a character.</div><iframe src=\"https://deorum.vercel.app/encounter/4441\" width=\"375\" height=\"600\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups\"></iframe>"},{"id":"marker69","name":"Random encounter","legend":"<div>You have encountered a character.</div><iframe src=\"https://deorum.vercel.app/encounter/156